cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository using the metadata below."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: "AeroBrain: Motion-Adaptive Memory and Template Motion Priors for Aerial Navigation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Junli"
url: "https://github.com/Ideal-ljl/AeroBrain-project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ideal-ljl/AeroBrain-project"
abstract: >-
  AeroBrain provides model definitions and checkpoint loading for an aerial
  vision-language-action model combining a Qwen3.5 backbone, Motion-Adaptive
  Memory, a template motion prior, and an action Expert. The source includes
  a synthetic CPU checkpoint and inference verification test. Trained weights,
  datasets, and navigation benchmarks are not included.
keywords:
  - aerial navigation
  - vision-language-action models
  - motion-adaptive memory
  - motion priors
  - robotics
